{"4320190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Your Grandma", "steam_appid": 4320190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Grandma</strong> is a light and heartwarming desktop pet game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She, with her silver hair, will always stay on your desktop—<br>keeping you company while you play games, procrastinate, work late, or watch videos…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you’re busy or lost in thought,<br>her gentle presence reminds you—<br>you’re not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can treat her as a pet, a desktop mascot,<br>or simply a quiet little presence that stays by your side.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The character reacts to the position of your mouse with eye-tracking behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the left mouse button to move the character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While moving, use the mouse wheel to adjust the character’s scale</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a cute desktop pet character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once launched, the character will remain on your desktop, providing a relaxed and comforting companion experience</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Grandma</strong> is a light and heartwarming desktop pet game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She, with her silver hair, will always stay on your desktop—<br>keeping you company while you play games, procrastinate, work late, or watch videos…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you’re busy or lost in thought,<br>her gentle presence reminds you—<br>you’re not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can treat her as a pet, a desktop mascot,<br>or simply a quiet little presence that stays by your side.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\